        <profile id="29bc7b1c" name="Dance of Death" typeId="a915f3e9" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2451ab48">At the start of the Fight phase, select one of the following abilities for this unit to gain until the end of the phase: Hero's Prowess: Each time a model in this unit makes an attack, re-roll a Hit roll of 1. Villain's Doom: Each time a model in this unit makes an attack, add 1 to the Wound roll. Trickster's Grace: Each time an attack targets this unit, subtract 1 from the Hit roll.</characteristic>
